# Netlify custom headers.
#
# The previous contents used Cloudflare Pages syntax ("https://*.pages.dev/*")
# which Netlify does not understand, so the Netlify preview domain
# (venerable-sherbet-10d546.netlify.app) was serving a fully crawlable copy of
# the production site.
#
# Netlify rules must start with a path. Host-scoped rules are not supported here,
# so deploy-preview and branch noindex is handled in netlify.toml instead, which
# does support per-context configuration.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()

# Hashed build assets are immutable, so they can be cached indefinitely.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/og-image.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
